# No Gradients

Never use CSS gradients anywhere in this app (`linear-gradient`, `radial-gradient`, `conic-gradient`, or gradient tokens).

## Rules

- Backgrounds, fills, progress bars, dividers, badges, cards, and overlays must be **solid colors** (or a single `color-mix` / token).
- Do not add atmospheric page glows, haze layers, or multi-stop background images for decoration.
- Prefer tokens from `css/tokens.css` (`--bg`, `--surface`, `--card`, `--primary`, etc.).
- Depth comes from solid surface tones, borders, and shadows — not gradients.

## Examples

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--gold));
background-image: radial-gradient(...), var(--bg);

/* ✅ GOOD */
background: var(--primary);
background: var(--bg);
background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 12%, var(--card));
```
